:::dlmfChapter "https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.11"
Source: NIST Digital Library of Mathematical Functions, §4.11.
:::

Section 4.11 is a reference section rather than a formula section.  It
contains no numbered displays, tables, or graphics.  For infinite series
involving logarithms or exponentials, the DLMF directs the reader to the
specialist references listed on the source page: Gradshteyn and Ryzhik,
Hansen, and Prudnikov and collaborators.  The neighboring sections are
§4.10 on integrals and §4.12 on generalized logarithms and exponentials.
